      "lang" : "en",
      "description" : [ "A polymer composed of PEG-ylated sorbitan, where the total number of poly(ethylene glycol) units is 20 (<em>w</em> + <em>x</em> + <em>y</em> + <em>z</em> = 20) and a single terminal is capped by an oleoyl group." ],
